  "description": "Conversion of the house into two self contained flats",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property has an original net internal floor area of less than 130 square metres and fails to provide a family sized unit on the ground floor.  As such, the proposal fails to comply with Local Plan policy SC6 and is considered unsuitable for conversion in principle; resulting in harm to the  character of the area from over-intensification of the site and loss of a small family dwelling",
    "Reason : 2 - The development has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not have an adverse impact upon on-street parking conditions to the detriment of highway and pedestrian safety, which is contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2 "
